    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s so quiet today. even the rats have stopped moving around. i can’t even feel the hunger anymore, it’s just this heavy, cold emptiness in my chest. the drums from the enemy camp... they're getting louder every night. there's nothing left here but dust and waiting for them to break down the gates. i don't think i want to see what happens when they do.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
